exports[`/bookings/new markup (pay links off) > blank form, pricing ready 1`] = `"<div class="cl-fade-in flex flex-col gap-4 p-4 md:p-7"><a class="text-[12px] font-extrabold text-ink-2 hover:text-ink" href="/bookings">← All bookings</a><div><h1 class="text-[21px] font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-[30px]">New booking</h1><p class="text-[12px] text-ink-2">For phone and in-person orders. No payment is taken here — the booking starts unpaid; record cash/check or send a QuickBooks invoice from the booking page.</p></div><form class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]"><input type="hidden" name="size" value="15yd"/><input type="hidden" name="deliveryDate" value=""/><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><section class="border-2 border-line-strong bg-surface"><div class="border-b-2 border-line-strong px-4 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Size &amp; delivery date</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="border-2 px-3 py-2 text-[12px] font-extrabold border-line hover:border-ink">10 yard</button><button type="button" class="border-2 px-3 py-2 text-[12px] font-extrabold border-ink bg-ink text-surface">15 yard</button><button type="button" class="border-2 px-3 py-2 text-[12px] font-extrabold border-line hover:border-ink">20 yard</button></div><div data-stub="calendar"></div><p class="text-[11px] text-ink-3">Earliest delivery is tomorrow. Availability is re-checked when you submit, under the same lock as online checkout.</p></div></section><section class="border-2 border-line-strong bg-surface"><div class="border-b-2 border-line-strong px-4 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Delivery address</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4"><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Street</span><input name="street" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_1fr]"><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">City</span><input name="city" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">State</span><input name="state" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value="OH"/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">ZIP</span><input name="zip" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Placement</span><select name="placement" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink"><option selected="">Driveway</option><option>Street</option><option>Yard</option><option>Other — see notes</option></select></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Debris</span><select name="debrisType" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink"><option value="" selected="">—</option><option>Household junk</option><option>Renovation debris</option><option>Roofing</option><option>Yard waste</option><option>Other</option></select></label></div><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Notes for the driver</span><input name="placementNotes" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink"/></label></div></section></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><section class="border-2 border-line-strong bg-surface"><div class="border-b-2 border-line-strong px-4 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Customer</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4"><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Name</span><input name="contactName" required="" autoComplete="off" role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="customer-search-results" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Phone</span><input name="contactPhone" type="tel" autoComplete="off" role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="customer-search-results" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Email — needed for a QuickBooks pay link</span><input name="contactEmail" type="email" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Company (optional)</span><input name="companyName" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-ink-2"><input type="checkbox" name="smsConsent" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-none accent-teal"/><span>Customer agreed to automated text updates (confirmation, arrival, pickup). Ask on the call — leaving this unchecked turns texts off for this customer.</span></label></div></section><section class="border-2 border-line-strong bg-surface"><div class="border-b-2 border-line-strong px-4 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Summary</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-ink-2">Size</span><span class="font-bold">15 yd · 5 days</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-ink-2">Delivery</span><span class="font-bold">Pick a date</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-ink-2">Pickup</span><span class="font-bold">—</span></div><div class="mt-1 flex justify-between border-t-2 border-line-strong pt-2"><span class="text-ink-2">Due ($350.00 + $25.38 tax)</span><span class="cl-nums text-[16px] font-black">$375.38</span></div></div><p class="text-[11px] text-ink-3">The customer gets the booking confirmation (email, and SMS only if they agreed) showing this amount as due.</p><button disabled="" class="self-start bg-teal px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-extrabold text-white hover:bg-teal-700 disabled:opacity-60">Create booking (unpaid)</button></div></section></div></form></div>"`;

