cking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Previous addresses</span><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" class="border-2 border-line px-2.5 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] font-bold hover:border-ink">1 Test St, Columbus, OH 43004</button><button type="button" disabled="" title="This address can&#x27;t be split into street, city, state and ZIP" class="border-2 border-line px-2.5 py-1.5 text-left text-[12px] text-ink-3 opacity-60">Lot 4 behind the barn — type it</button><button type="button" class="border-2 border-line px-2.5 py-1.5 text-[12px] font-extrabold hover:border-ink">New address</button></div></div><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Street</span><input name="street" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-[2fr_1fr_1fr]"><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">City</span><input name="city" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">State</span><input name="state" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value="OH"/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">ZIP</span><input name="zip" required="" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value=""/></label></div><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Placement</span><select name="placement" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink"><option selected="">Driveway</option><option>Street</