anded="false" aria-controls="customer-search-results" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value="+16145550142"/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Email — needed for a QuickBooks pay link</span><input name="contactEmail" type="email" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value="pat@crazylarrys.test"/></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1"><span class="text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-3">Company (optional)</span><input name="companyName" class="w-full border-2 border-line bg-bg px-2.5 py-2 text-[13px] text-ink" value="Example Roofing"/></label><label class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[13px] text-ink-2"><input type="checkbox" name="smsConsent" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 flex-none accent-teal"/><span>Customer agreed to automated text updates (confirmation, arrival, pickup). Ask on the call — leaving this unchecked turns texts off for this customer.</span></label><p class="pl-6 text-[12px] font-semibold text-ink-2" data-testid="consent-on-file">On file: agreed to texts (by phone, Nov 3)</p></div></section><section class="border-2 border-line-strong bg-surface"><div class="border-b-2 border-line-strong px-4 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[0.16em]">Summary</div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-4"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-ink-2">Size</span><span class="font-bold">15 yd · 5 days</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-ink-2">Delivery</span><span class="font-bold">Pick a date</span></div><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="text-ink-2">Pickup</span><span class="font-bold">—</span></div><div class="mt-1 flex justify-between border-t-2 border-line-strong pt-2"><span class="text-ink-2">Due ($350.00 + $25.38 tax)</span><span class="cl-nums text-[16px] font-